    "$comment": "Every theme reference has exactly the same banner titles and order as its entry (checked when this file was generated). In 2.1.1 they also sit at the same lines (only the trailing newline differs), but locate them by title rather than relying on that. Azure is built into tokens/, so femto.css itself is the azure reference."
  },
